{{Stat|Charm Chance}} is a {{Skl|Hunting}} stat. It increases the chance of capturing the [[Attribute Shard]] of certain [[Mobs]] when they are killed.

== Charming Mechanics == 
If a player has any {{Stat|Charm Chance}} effect active, they can capture the [[Attribute Shard]] of certain [[Mobs]] upon death. The amount of shards gained is dependent on the player's {{Stat|hf}}.

[[Mobs]] cannot be charmed if a [[Black Hole]] is used to hunt them. However, charmable [[Mobs]] hunted with a [[Lasso]] or [[Fishing Net]] still can be charmed.

The {{Stat|Charm Chance}} can be increased through various ways:

